Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看一个来自本周代码的谜题\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Here's a puzzle from this week's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:05.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,setup 崩溃了，报的是 AttributeError\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Setup crashes with an attribute error:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:09.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,scGenModel 没有叫 x_dimensions 的属性——结尾带 s 的那个\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}scGenModel has no attribute x_dimensions, with an s.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:14.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看起来改一个字母就能修好：删掉 s，崩溃就消失了\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The fix looks like one letter. Delete the s, and the crash disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:18.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们在只有四个基因的玩具数据上、用一个模拟的 scgen（stub）试过\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}We tried it on toy data with four genes, and a stand-in for scgen:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,setup 顺利跑完，没有任何报错\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}setup runs, no complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:24.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可网络会按一千个基因来建，而不是四个\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}But the network would be built for one thousand genes, not four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报错没了，bug 还在\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The error is gone, and the bug is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:30.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要弄明白原因，我们得跟着一个名字走过五个地方\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}To see why, follow one name through five places.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:37.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看看你旁观 Josh 工作时的那套环境：三个窗口\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}First, the setup you watched Josh work in: three windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:42.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,包的代码文件、配置文件，还有运行它们的 e24_replica notebook\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The package file, the config file, and the e24_replica notebook that runs them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两根线把它们连起来\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Two wires connect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:47.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可编辑安装，也就是 pip install 里的 -e\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The editable install, the dash e in pip install,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:51.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,意味着 Python 导入的是你的文件夹本身，而不是一份冻结的副本\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}means Python imports your folder itself, not a frozen copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:57.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,notebook 顶部的 autoreload 会在文件改动后重新读取它\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}And autoreload, at the top of the notebook, re-reads the file whenever it changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置这根线更简单：每新建一个 Experiment\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The config wire is even simpler. Every new
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:05.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它都会用 yaml.safe_load 重新打开并读取 config.yaml\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Experiment opens config.yaml and reads it fresh, with yaml.safe_load.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:09.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以循环就是：改文件、重跑那个单元格、看哪里坏了\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}So the loop is: edit a file, rerun the cell, read what breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:12.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你看到 Josh 来回切换，做的就是这个循环\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}That loop is what you watched Josh do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:19.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跟踪一个值：潜空间大小 z_dimension，等于 50\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Now follow one value: the latent size, z_dimension, fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.01,0:01:23.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一跳：它是 config.yaml 里的一行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Hop one: it's a line in config.yaml,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:25.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,位于 models 下面的 scGenModel 里\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}under models, under scGenModel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:30.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二跳：safe_load 把整个文件变成层层嵌套的 Python 字典\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Hop two: safe load turns the whole file into nested Python dictionaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:35.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,字典就像一排贴着标签的抽屉：必须用一模一样的标签才能打开\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}A dictionary is a row of labelled drawers. You open one by its exact label.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:39.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三跳：Experiment 的 setup 在第 115 行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Hop three: the experiment's setup, at line 115,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:42.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 scGenModel 这一格（一个小字典）交给 scGenModel 类\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}hands the scGenModel drawer to the class,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:45.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,init 打开标着 z_dimension 的抽屉\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}and init opens the drawer labelled z_dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:51.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四跳：init 把值写到对象身上，成为 self.z_dimension\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Hop four: init writes the value onto the object, as self.z_dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:57.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五个地方：模型自己的 setup 方法在第 254 行读取这个属性来搭建网络\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Fifth, the model's own setup method, at line 254, reads that attribute to build the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:02:02.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意，等号左边的名字是 scgen 自己的参数名\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Careful there: the name left of the equals sign is scgen's own parameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:05.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的名字是 self. 后面那个\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Ours is the one after self dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:08.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个地方，每一处的拼写都必须一致\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Five places, and the spelling has to match at every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 Josh 不停在文件之间跳来跳去的原因\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}That's why Josh kept jumping between files.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:21.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条路上有两种查找，失败时各报各的错\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}That path has two kinds of lookup, and each one fails with its own error.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:25.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开一个不存在的抽屉，会抛出 KeyError\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Opening a drawer that doesn't exist raises a key error.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:29.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,向对象要一个它从没得到过的属性，会抛出 AttributeError\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Asking an object for an attribute it never received raises an attribute error.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:35.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,停下来猜一猜：Josh 的 toy config 里写的是带 s 的 x_dimensions\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Pause and predict: Josh's toy config spells it x_dimensions, with an s.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:38.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,init 会抛出 KeyError，还是 AttributeError？\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Will init raise a key error, or an attribute error?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是 KeyError\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}A key error.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:49.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 toy config 构建 scGenModel，init 会停在第 220 行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Build scGenModel from the toy config, and init stops at line 220:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:51.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,KeyError: 'x_dimension'，单数\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}key error, x_dimension, singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它要找的那个抽屉不存在\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The drawer it asked for isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:57.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 253 行的崩溃就是 AttributeError\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}And the attribute error is our crash at line 253:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:03.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型的 setup 要的是 self.x_dimensions，而 init 只写过单数形式\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}the model's setup asks for self.x_dimensions, but init only ever wrote the singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:06.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,读 traceback 要从最底下开始\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}To read a traceback, start at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:10.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一行告诉你出了什么错，这里 Python 甚至会问\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The last line says what went wrong, and here Python even asks:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你是不是想写 x_dimension？\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}did you mean x_dimension?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:15.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再往上，最后一个文件和行号告诉你错在哪里\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Just above it, the last file and line says where.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:18.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,继续往上读，就能看到调用路径\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Read further up and you see the path:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:24.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Experiment 的 setup 在第 119 行，调用了模型的 setup，在第 253 行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}the experiment's setup, at line 119, called the model's setup, at line 253.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:27.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提醒一句：这是用替身 scgen 测到的\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}One caution: we measured this with a stand-in for scgen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:33.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在集群上，可能会先出现另一个和 scgen 有关的报错，第四集会解释原因\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}On the cluster, a different scgen error can come first. Episode four explains why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是不报错的那一半\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Now the silent part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,当 use_all_genes 为真时\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}When use_all_genes is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:48.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Experiment 的 setup 本该用从数据里读到的真实基因数\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}the experiment's setup is meant to replace the typed gene count with the real one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:49.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,替换手写的基因数\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}read from the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:51.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 104 行做的就是这件事\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Line 104 does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:55.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可第 104 行写入的是带 s 的 x_dimensions\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}But line 104 writes x_dimensions, with an s.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:04:00.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,往一个不存在的标签里写值，从来不会报错：Python 只会新加一个抽屉\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Writing to a label that doesn't exist never complains: Python just adds a new drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:06.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,于是字典里出现了两个抽屉：单数的 x_dimension，手写的 1000\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}So the dictionary ends up with two drawers: x_dimension, singular, one thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:10.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有带 s 的 x_dimensions，真实的基因数\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}typed by hand, and x_dimensions, with an s, the real count.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:16.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,init 只打开单数的那个抽屉，于是真实的基因数落进了一个没人读的抽屉\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Init only opens the singular drawer, so the real count lands in a drawer nobody reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Josh 的真实数据上\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}On Josh's real data,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:22.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,他的 notebook 曾经打印过这个抽屉：18,024\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}his notebook once printed that drawer: eighteen thousand and twenty-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:24.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按现在的 init，没有人读它\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}With today's init, nothing reads it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:28.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里停一下：基因数真的应该手写进配置里吗？\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Pause on this: should the gene count be typed into the config at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还是应该永远从数据里来？\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}or should it always come from the data?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:42.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下面四条规则，能把这种来回折腾变成一套固定流程\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Four rules turn this back-and-forth into a routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，只用一种拼写\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}One: one spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:48.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置里的键、init 里的那一行、对象的属性，用同一个名字\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}The config key, the init line, and the attribute share exactly one name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:54.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二，能推导出来的值就推导：数据能告诉你的数字，不要手写\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Two: derived values are derived. A number the data can tell you shouldn't be typed by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三，尽早失败\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Three: fail early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:05:00.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,init 在对象建好的那一刻就读取了所有键\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Init already reads every key the moment the object is built.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:04.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这很好：缺一个键，会在 init 里就爆出来，而不是训练一小时之后\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}That's good: a missing key explodes inside init, not an hour into training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:10.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四，任何改名之后，都在整个项目里搜索旧名字，包括 YAML 文件\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Four: after any rename, search the whole project for the old name, YAML files included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后重跑手头最小的例子\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Then rerun the smallest example you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:17.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天就该检查的两个坑：Josh 的 toy config 已经和代码对不上了\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Two traps to check today. Josh's toy config has drifted:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:21.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它没有 experiment 段，setup 会停在第 86 行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}it has no experiment section, so setup stops at line 86,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:25.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它也缺少 z_dimension、alpha 和 dropout_rate\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}and it also lacks z_dimension, alpha and dropout rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:28.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另外，在 YAML 里 None 只是一个普通单词、一个字符串\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}And in YAML, None is just the word None, a string.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:30.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,YAML 的空值写作 null\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}YAML spells an empty value null.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:35.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天这还没有害处，但任何判断是否为 None 的检查都会悄悄出错\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}That's harmless today, but any check for None would quietly get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:44.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾一下。一个配置值要经过五个地方\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Recap. A config value passes through five places:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:50.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,YAML 的一行、字典的抽屉、init、对象属性，以及读取它的 setup\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}a YAML line, a dictionary drawer, init, an attribute, and the setup that reads it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个地方拼写都必须相同\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Every place needs the same spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:55.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,KeyError 说明少了一个抽屉\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}A key error means a drawer is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:59.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,AttributeError 说明对象身上从没写过这个属性\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}An attribute error means the object never got that attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:02.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且，一个不报错的 bug 可能就藏在一个被修好的崩溃后面\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}And a quiet bug can hide behind a fixed crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:07.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的练习：在整个项目里搜索两种拼写，保留单数的 x_dimension\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Your exercise: search the project for both spellings, and keep the singular, x_dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:13.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它已经和 config.yaml、init 一致，也正是 scgen 自己的参数名\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}It already matches config.yaml and init, and it's the name of scgen's own parameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:20.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把第 104 行、第 253 行等号右边，以及 toy config 改成一致\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Change line 104, the right-hand side of line 253, and the toy config to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:23.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后重跑 e24_replica\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Then rerun e24_replica,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:28.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查模型的 x_dimension 现在是不是真实的基因数\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}and check that the model's x_dimension is now the real gene count,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:32.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,即使 setup 仍然停在第 252 行\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}even if setup still stops at line 252.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:34.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那一处会在第四集解释\N{\fs30\fnInter\c&H00C9C9C9&\bord0}Episode four explains that stop.
